# ...except the Tauri shell's, which is not a build output at all: two
# symlinks naming exactly the files the window loads, which is what keeps
# frontendDist from serving the whole of clients/gui. Ignored along with
# every real dist/, the shell could not be built from a fresh clone -- the
# directory simply was not there.
!clients/gui/app/dist/
